f squares:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}16{a}^{2}-81 & =(4a)^{2}-{9}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we factor the expression using the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(4a)^{2}-{9}^{2} & =(4a+9)(4a-9)\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064692 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064339 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8aa1c2ce-6229-5af9-b9b3-870a7e661143" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring a Difference of Squares Containing More Than One Variable"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "58d24321-d687-5666-b444-c67333ddf888" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2e-4f)(2e+4f)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485017} {:answer/id #uuid "883f814c-6c18-5941-967b-2ebea351df17" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2e-4f)(2e-4f)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485113} {:answer/id #uuid "a2d7f83e-938d-58ce-b03e-2aa0fbe0f394" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(e-2f)(e+2f)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485171} {:answer/id #uuid "b13e591a-bf5d-5ccb-bebd-477bcfb2fa24" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2e+4f)(2e+4f)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485202} {:answer/id #uuid "fdc225a0-8ce8-5951-977f-0f5267f0a478" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(e-2f)(e-2f)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485360}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "58d24321-d687-5666-b444-c67333ddf888" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2e-4f)(2e+4f)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485017} :answer-field/id #uuid "2bdfff3f-3f1d-5467-b903-2b86371c55b2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186062209}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0ca5943c-81c0-5244-b701-34175b2232ae" :question/math-academy-id "q-2833" :question/problem "Express $4{e}^{2}-16{f}^{2}$ as a product of two binomials." :question/worked-solution "We factor the expression using the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{e}^{2}-16{f}^{2} & = \\\\ (2e)^{2}-(4f)^{2} & = \\\\ (2e-4f)(2e+4f) & \\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186485546 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064328 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "20900ac7-ad4e-5895-8d95-d66b0e5f7360" :knowledge-point/title "Factoring a Difference of Squares"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "206acbc9-87db-578e-b3b2-16b30eb642bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(9-x)(9+x)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186484877} {:answer/id #uuid "39335b45-13f8-58f6-bd9b-9a97b1c75cc2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(9-x)^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186484937} {:answer/id #uuid "64dfcde6-8a80-5dd4-b6fd-951b6b011f44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(9+x)^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485036} {:answer/id #uuid "6faf371b-64f9-55f0-8fd0-2ade74e5df26" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-9)(x+9)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485056} {:answer/id #uuid "8e7eccde-081c-5f5d-be03-c306f58839d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(18-x)(18+x)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485125}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "206acbc9-87db-578e-b3b2-16b30eb642bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(9-x)(9+x)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186484877} :answer-field/id #uuid "8cab9527-ddd1-529a-ae51-224da9fcc4cc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186485423}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "7a010f5a-cc94-5c4d-81d2-4c21165ae9ab" :question/math-academy-id "q-44102" :question/problem "$81-{x}^{2}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we write the expression as a difference of squares:\n\n$$\n81-{x}^{2}={9}^{2}-{x}^{2}\n$$\n\nThen, we factor the expression using the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n{9}^{2}-{x}^{2}=(9-x)(9+x)\n$$"}]}
